<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>[TreeView] 해당 노드의 label style 변경하기</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_32c219f786bcb9c4" class="chapter_title">[TreeView] 해당 노드의 label style 변경하기</h1><h1 id="r_aff1ee9e37dee11e" class="element heading1" data-element-id="aff1ee9e37dee11e"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><pre id="r_7a37e4de9665f387" class="element pre" data-element-id="7a37e4de9665f387">TreeView의 'setLabelStyle' 메소드를 사용하여 해당 노드의 label style을 변경하는 예제입니다.</pre><p id="r_55d0af67a24e665c" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="55d0af67a24e665c"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00465">P00465</a></p><h1 id="r_3103882471cf61db" class="element heading1" data-element-id="3103882471cf61db"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_074b228bc89ac6f9" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="074b228bc89ac6f9"><li><p>노드 스타일 변경하기</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_2fc10ec194ac470d" class="element heading1" data-element-id="2fc10ec194ac470d"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_3c857672a69ad884" class="element heading2" data-element-id="3c857672a69ad884"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>노드 스타일 변경하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_200c28bc7e5c92bc" class="element step1" data-element-id="200c28bc7e5c92bc"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: 초기 상태를 확인합니다.</p></div><pre id="r_4668eb925080b566" class="element pre step1_indent" data-element-id="4668eb925080b566">예제 영역 '<span class="r_th_title_1_span">노드 스타일 변경</span>' 에서 TreeView가 구성되어 있고 모든 노드의 색상이 검정색인 것을 확인합니다.</pre><div id="r_864b97a1b605284f" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="864b97a1b605284f"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 1.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1548.png" width="210" height="272" /></p></div><div id="r_c4d6c7f6a2ffcd78" class="element step1" data-element-id="c4d6c7f6a2ffcd78"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: 버튼을 누릅니다.</p></div><pre id="r_18d8a1356075a65e" class="element pre step1_indent" data-element-id="18d8a1356075a65e">'<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">스타일 변경하기</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</pre><div id="r_307189d8a742cdf5" class="element step1" data-element-id="307189d8a742cdf5"><p class="step1_n">3</p><p>STEP 3: 실행된 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><pre id="r_58d559dc7874c71d" class="element pre step1_indent" data-element-id="58d559dc7874c71d">'라벨A-1' 밑의 노드는 전부 색상이 'orange'로 바뀌는 것을 확인합니다.</pre><div id="r_84b9d04fda94301f" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="84b9d04fda94301f"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 2.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image1549.png" width="169" height="251" /></p></div><h1 id="r_6d07e76982626e8b" class="element heading1" data-element-id="6d07e76982626e8b"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_7d6f619a24044ddc" class="element heading2" data-element-id="7d6f619a24044ddc"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>모든 노드의 선택 해제하기</span></div></h2><pre id="r_c3d402d97c0a707d" class="element pre" data-element-id="c3d402d97c0a707d">TreeView의 'setLabelStyle' 메소드를 사용하여 스크립트를 작성합니다.</pre><div id="r_f990ad08e1de2532" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="f990ad08e1de2532"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>scwin.btn_ex1_onclick = <span class="r_h_keyword_span">function</span> (e) {
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">// 2번째 노드의 색상을 orange로 바꿔줍니다. (해당 노드의 하위 노드도 전부 적용)</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;trv2.setLabelStyle(<span class="r_h_number_span">2</span>, <span class="r_h_string_span">"color"</span>, <span class="r_h_string_span">"orange"</span>, <span class="r_h_keyword_span">true</span>);
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>};</pre></div><h1 id="r_80483cb79d70d1d8" class="element heading1" data-element-id="80483cb79d70d1d8"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">5</span><span>주요 API</span></div></h1><ul id="r_44326775c8ae2dbe" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="44326775c8ae2dbe"><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_method_span">setLabelStyle( )</span></p></li></ul></div></body></html>